358
00:19:40,580 --> 00:19:41,180
Good.

359
00:19:41,760 --> 00:19:43,400
I can finally go see Marie.

360
00:19:43,720 --> 00:19:45,440
Um, thank you for everything!

361
00:19:45,760 --> 00:19:46,420
See ya!

362
00:19:47,120 --> 00:19:48,280
Bye-bye!

363
